mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> (xem hình vē). Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là hơp lực của ba lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> (tức là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> ), tính công sinh ra bởi lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> biết vật dịch chuyển một đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math> mét và cùng hướng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/cf5571428ba11c372aa8b90ea97c1b95387c01c57ea7795c60d11cc78cad9706.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
