  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> (với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành).<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> cùng chiều với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy  sinh ra bởi lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> biết vật dịch chuyển một đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math> mét và cùng hướng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math> J.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e2c78cd010a3edd2d9df394424baf8b33a102ce6b06b4eec08d88977276c0fd6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure><